        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:NorGrith">Nor. Cyricgrið</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Andpreoste cyricgangas syndan forbodene wifum 7 wæpnum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">[3] And a priest is forbidden from attending church with women or weapons.</ab>
